# PROJECT TITLE

AICTE SmartVerify AI — Intelligent Application Validation, Document Authentication & Regulatory Compliance Platform

## 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Build a complete, modern, advanced, attractive, responsive, and interactive AI-powered website for the All India Council for Technical Education (AICTE).

The platform should help AICTE officials and technical institutions validate applications, inspect supporting documents, detect potential document anomalies, verify documents through authorized sources, check regulatory compliance, identify infrastructure deficiencies, and generate transparent validation reports.

The platform must function as a working prototype, not merely a static UI design.

Create realistic interactions, functional buttons, forms, upload workflows, dashboards, tables, notifications, filters, search, charts, and navigation.

Use synthetic demonstration data wherever actual AICTE data or authorized external verification services are unavailable.

IMPORTANT: The system is an AI-assisted decision-support platform. It must never automatically declare a document fraudulent or reject an institution solely because of an AI-generated flag. All adverse findings must be reviewed by authorized officials.

